1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Strange enough to notice"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"August 5, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"3 minutes"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-On an unusually warm weekday in April, I committed a small crime of opportunity.",{"children":"On an unusually warm weekday in April, I committed a small crime of opportunity."}],["$","p","1-I was between projects—the quiet side of a feast-or-famine business—and work had not claimed the day yet. Before it could, I ran for it, driving north to Minnewaska State Park Preserve. I knew parts of Severance had been filmed there, that was enough of a plan.",{"children":"I was between projects—the quiet side of a feast-or-famine business—and work had not claimed the day yet. Before it could, I ran for it, driving north to Minnewaska State Park Preserve. I knew parts of Severance had been filmed there, that was enough of a plan."}],["$","p","2-I like road trips, being outside, and finding places close to home that I have somehow missed. I was also curious about the show’s outdoor world: bleak, Gothic, slightly unreal. I wanted to see how much of that feeling belonged to the locations themselves.",{"children":"I like road trips, being outside, and finding places close to home that I have somehow missed. I was also curious about the show’s outdoor world: bleak, Gothic, slightly unreal. I wanted to see how much of that feeling belonged to the locations themselves."}],["$","p","3-At the gate, I paid the ranger. I saw a three tourists in the lodge. After that, no one.",{"children":"At the gate, I paid the ranger. I saw a three tourists in the lodge. After that, no one."}],["$","p","4-Minnewaska has absolutely no shortage of dense forests or dizzying cliffs. There is only one breathtaking waterfall however. I hiked down to it with the fun feeling that I had borrowed the whole preserve for the afternoon.",{"children":"Minnewaska has absolutely no shortage of dense forests or dizzying cliffs. There is only one breathtaking waterfall however. I hiked down to it with the fun feeling that I had borrowed the whole preserve for the afternoon."}],["$","p","5-I expected it to feel eerie there because of the show. It didn’t. It felt quiet and restorative. The place was beautiful, but it had clearly not been waiting around to be Severance. The color, framing, weather, and story had done much of that work.",{"children":"I expected it to feel eerie there because of the show. It didn’t. It felt quiet and restorative. The place was beautiful, but it had clearly not been waiting around to be Severance. The color, framing, weather, and story had done much of that work."}],["$","p","6-I liked discovering the gap between the real place and the fictional one. At one of the locations, I could see several paths a camera might have taken. There was no inevitable shot sitting there. Someone had walked around, looked at the rocks and water, and decided what the place could become.",{"children":"I liked discovering the gap between the real place and the fictional one. At one of the locations, I could see several paths a camera might have taken. There was no inevitable shot sitting there. Someone had walked around, looked at the rocks and water, and decided what the place could become."}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10"],null]}],"$L11"]}]]}]}]
b:["$","p","7-That made the scene more interesting to me, not less. It reminded me that looking is not simply finding the unusual thing. Sometimes it is noticing an unusual possibility inside something that already exists.",{"children":"That made the scene more interesting to me, not less. It reminded me that looking is not simply finding the unusual thing. Sometimes it is noticing an unusual possibility inside something that already exists."}]
c:["$","p","8-I didn’t have a single fixed objective for the day. I wanted to get out of my routine and let things happen. This is usually a good enough reason for me to go somewhere.",{"children":"I didn’t have a single fixed objective for the day. I wanted to get out of my routine and let things happen. This is usually a good enough reason for me to go somewhere."}]
d:["$","p","9-I try to find a small edge (not a cliff) I am slightly reluctant to cross. Take an unclaimed weekday. Drive without much of a plan. Walk alone. Step across the water. One edge tends to lead to another.",{"children":"I try to find a small edge (not a cliff) I am slightly reluctant to cross. Take an unclaimed weekday. Drive without much of a plan. Walk alone. Step across the water. One edge tends to lead to another."}]
e:["$","p","10-Chance matters in my work for the same reason. I bring in another person, an unfamiliar reference, a random constraint, or AI because I want something to enter that I couldn’t have planned by myself.",{"children":"Chance matters in my work for the same reason. I bring in another person, an unfamiliar reference, a random constraint, or AI because I want something to enter that I couldn’t have planned by myself."}]
f:["$","p","11-On a cover design for the Las Vegas Sands, I was looking for a natural image that could sit beside an architectural detail with a curling form. AI produced a picture of fiddleheads. Strangely, their curves mirrored the architecture and accidentally formed an S, for Sands.",{"children":"On a cover design for the Las Vegas Sands, I was looking for a natural image that could sit beside an architectural detail with a curling form. AI produced a picture of fiddleheads. Strangely, their curves mirrored the architecture and accidentally formed an S, for Sands."}]
10:["$","p","12-I would not have planned it, but I still had to notice it. Chance can place something in front of me. It can’t make me care or decide what to do with it. But if I'm open to it, can go to a park, walk to a waterfall, and come home, having a day strange enough to notice things.",{"children":"I would not have planned it, but I still had to notice it. Chance can place something in front of me. It can’t make me care or decide what to do with it. But if I'm open to it, can go to a park, walk to a waterfall, and come home, having a day strange enough to notice things."}]
11:["$","footer",null,{"className":"footer","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"footer-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"footer-links","aria-label":"Site","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:hello@thinking.haus","children":"About"}],["$","$La",null,{"href":"/","aria-current":"page","children":"Lists"}]]}]]}]
